# CODEOWNERS - Boi-Khata Android
#
# GitHub auto-requests review from the owner listed for any path a PR touches.
# Later rules override earlier ones, so the most specific rule must come LAST.
#
# NOTE: only GitHub users/teams with write access can be code owners.
# The Boi-Khata Coder agent is an integration, not a user, so it can never be
# listed here. Agent restrictions are enforced by AGENT_GUARDRAILS.md G1-G6
# plus branch protection on `main`, not by this file.
#
# Required setting (manual, one-time):
#   Settings > Branches > main > Require review from Code Owners
#
# Path globs below were verified against settings.gradle.kts on 2026-09-05.
# Real modules: app, core/{database,domain,cloud,designsystem,common},
# feature/{home,sale,catalog,khata,expense,supplier,reports,subscription,
# melamode,support}, shared/receipt.  There is NO data/ directory.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Default owner for everything
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*                           @mraaisa-afk

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OWNER-ONLY ZONE - agent may propose, Sakira must review
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Gate + decision files (D66: PROGRESS.md is the sole gate owner)
/PROGRESS.md                @mraaisa-afk
/DECISIONS.md               @mraaisa-afk
/CONVENTIONS.md             @mraaisa-afk
/ARCHITECTURE.md            @mraaisa-afk

# Agent behaviour contracts
